                          Forestry

Forestry gathers construction wood from marked timber stands in the
Kingswood. The profession building is 4e, n from Center of Town. In its
general store, use 'list' and 'buy forestry axe'. Carry the axe to a visible
harvestable timber stand in the Kingswood and use:

  chop tree

The stand is exhausted after a successful harvest and returns when its virtual
room resets. Forestry skill increases yield and can produce fine, superior, or
masterwork oak, ash, and pine timber. Timber is saved automatically rather
than carried as a normal inventory object.

  reagents wood       Show saved timber, planks, and framing bundles.
  carpentry list      Show timber refinement and crafting plans.
  help carpentry      Explain refinement, furniture, and construction supply.

Carpentry works in the Kingdom Commons or inside any homestead. Preserve the
harvested species and quality when milling and crafting. For example:

  carpentry mill pine 1
  carpentry craft pine stool

If 'reagents wood' shows Fine Pine Timber, use 'carpentry mill fine pine 1'
and 'carpentry craft fine pine stool'. One timber becomes two matching planks.
